WEBVTT

00:02:10.097 --> 00:02:12.031
Time certainly flies, Boss.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:17.597
It's already been five years now...

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:37.947
"Gathering"

00:02:43.697 --> 00:02:45.893
Hanayama-san, huh...

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.999
Boss. About Hanma Baki...

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:55.718
Word has it that he's
back in the country...

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:57.887
There've been rumors for a while

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:03.993
that say that he's appeared
in some underground fighting arena...

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:07.783
I'm not sure where
that would be, though...

00:03:09.723 --> 00:03:11.782
Well, I gotta go.

00:03:22.069 --> 00:03:23.780
Hiya!

00:03:23.804 --> 00:03:25.915
Sir!

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:28.084
--Doppo!
--Sir...!

00:03:28.108 --> 00:03:30.219
How've you been?!

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.988
What a pleasant surprise!

00:03:32.012 --> 00:03:35.091
| would have come to you
had you asked...!

00:03:35.115 --> 00:03:41.130
Quit acting so reserved!
We're close friends here!

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:47.336
He's always idolized Orochi Doppo-sensei,
the "God of War"...

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.991
The Shinshinkai's head office
is breathtaking!

00:03:52.933 --> 00:03:57.046
I'd expect no less from the castle
of a world-renowned karate master!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.596
Just wonderful!

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:11.194
But this certainly is unexpected.
| haven't seen you since--

00:04:11.218 --> 00:04:16.466
| was just in the neighborhood
and thought we might talk over tea.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:20.654
You're the same as ever.
Why not be frank with me?

00:04:21.695 --> 00:04:25.441
Do you think you could bring
Katsumi-kun to the underground?

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:27.210
Katsumi?

00:04:27.234 --> 00:04:30.580
He's currently touring America.

00:04:30.604 --> 00:04:32.348
But why him?

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:37.453
| was just wondering who's stronger,
him or the Ogre's son.

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:40.456
The Ogre... Hanma Yujiro?!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.860
You certainly are easy
to understand, Doppo-chan!

00:04:43.884 --> 00:04:47.797
Sir! What is happening underground?!

00:04:47.821 --> 00:04:51.033
It's changed quite a bit since then.

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:56.405
A lad who popped up three years ago
is now the undefeated champion.

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:59.242
And he's the Ogre's son?!

00:04:59.266 --> 00:05:00.943
Hanma Baki.

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:08.967
| wanted to see Katsumi, the adopted
son of you, the former champion,

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:11.687
and the son of the Ogre fight!

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:15.591
But if he's out of the country,
it can't be helped...

00:05:15.615 --> 00:05:19.562
I'd love to meet this Hanma Baki...!

00:05:19.586 --> 00:05:24.400
| built this office to pave the way
for the younger generation,

00:05:24.424 --> 00:05:29.539
but I've never once forgotten
the days when I fought for you.

00:05:29.563 --> 00:05:34.310
And just hearing the
Ogre's name has me shaking...

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:35.444
Director!

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:37.994
What's going on?! I have company here!

00:05:38.939 --> 00:05:42.251
--I'm sorry, but it's Kato...!
--What? Kato?!

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:45.688
He's destroyed the dojo.
Could you possibly come?

00:05:45.712 --> 00:05:48.858
Go on! Don't mind me!

00:05:48.882 --> 00:05:50.960
Pardon me.

00:05:50.984 --> 00:05:56.286
Doppo-chan! If he's strong,
introduce him to me!

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:02.271
Kato!

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:04.941
How are ya, Mr. Director?

00:06:04.965 --> 00:06:07.877
It's been what? Three, no, four years?

00:06:07.901 --> 00:06:11.047
Kato. What is the meaning of this?

00:06:11.071 --> 00:06:16.152
Don't look at me. I just
came to ask you something.

00:06:16.176 --> 00:06:20.556
We have plenty of reason to crush you!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.525
After you ditched us 4 years ago,

00:06:22.549 --> 00:06:25.761
you did nothing but shame
the Shinshinkai's good name!

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:28.764
I'd say you did that yourselves.

00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:30.415
Bastard!

00:06:40.467 --> 00:06:45.248
| wanna find someone even stronger.

00:06:45.272 --> 00:06:48.517
| assume you know where I should go.

00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:50.419
Someone strong?

00:06:50.443 --> 00:06:52.688
Underground fighters.

00:06:52.712 --> 00:06:55.892
All my visitors today are kids...

00:06:55.916 --> 00:06:58.861
| heard about it during
my gang's executive meeting.

00:06:58.885 --> 00:07:01.597
Supposedly, there's this
really awesome place

00:07:01.621 --> 00:07:05.201
where they decide the
world's strongest man!

00:07:05.225 --> 00:07:07.370
Are you referring to my place?

00:07:07.394 --> 00:07:09.372
Sir!

00:07:09.396 --> 00:07:14.277
| saw what you did.
You're a real go-getter.

00:07:14.301 --> 00:07:17.546
--What's your name?
--Who're you?!

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:21.131
Me? I'm Mito Komon!
{famous Tokugawa lord)

00:07:22.542 --> 00:07:25.054
--Huh?
--Sir.

00:07:25.078 --> 00:07:31.861
This is Kato Kiyosumi, and until
four years ago, he was my best fighter.

00:07:31.885 --> 00:07:33.896
Your best, eh?

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:36.799
Wonderful! Truly wonderful!

00:07:36.823 --> 00:07:40.403
What's with you?!
Don't tell me you swing that way?!

00:07:40.427 --> 00:07:45.441
| suppose I can always wait
for Katsumi-kun to return, Doppo.

00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:49.245
Come visit sometime.
And bring that fellow with you!

00:07:49.269 --> 00:07:51.781
Baki's fight is coming up soon!

00:07:51.805 --> 00:07:53.534
Baki...?

00:07:55.775 --> 00:07:58.788
You came at just the right time.

00:07:58.812 --> 00:08:02.158
| got no idea what's goin' on...!

00:08:02.182 --> 00:08:06.662
--First, I make you pay for this.
--That hurts...!

00:08:06.686 --> 00:08:08.211
Here.

00:08:09.589 --> 00:08:11.683
Just one flick...?!

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.155
"Matsumoto”

00:08:24.971 --> 00:08:26.632
I'm home!

00:08:29.009 --> 00:08:31.120
Whoops...!

00:08:31.144 --> 00:08:33.789
Welcome home. Baki-kun's back.

00:08:33.813 --> 00:08:36.783
Yeah, I could hear from outside.

00:08:38.351 --> 00:08:41.719
--Go take Musashi his dinner...
--OK!

00:08:50.864 --> 00:08:52.375
Baki-kun...!

00:08:52.399 --> 00:08:56.178
Kozue-chan! It's been a while!

00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:57.279
Kozue-chan...?

00:08:57.303 --> 00:09:00.483
<i>Oh, here's Musashi's dinner.</i>

00:09:00.507 --> 00:09:04.000
Oh, thanks! Musashi! Food!

00:09:04.844 --> 00:09:06.489
That's not how you do it.

00:09:06.513 --> 00:09:10.826
You have to actually give it to him.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.495
Silly Musashi...!

00:09:12.519 --> 00:09:17.133
What's the deal, Musashi?
You never act that way with me...

00:09:17.157 --> 00:09:20.002
Because you're always
running off somewhere.

00:09:20.026 --> 00:09:24.273
Yeah, sorry. I just have
lots to do and stuff...

00:09:24.297 --> 00:09:26.575
You should apologize to him, not me.

00:09:26.599 --> 00:09:28.567
Yeah...

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:35.598
Sorry! I said a little too much!

00:09:39.145 --> 00:09:40.990
Wait...

00:09:41.014 --> 00:09:43.893
Thanks for always
taking care of Musashi...

00:09:43.917 --> 00:09:47.911
Come to school sometimes, ok?
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:10:00.967 --> 00:10:04.413
--Is something the matter?
--Landlady! What do you mean?

00:10:04.437 --> 00:10:07.016
Kozue was acting strangely...

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.052
She told me to come to school sometimes.

00:10:10.076 --> 00:10:13.656
That's a tall order...

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.258
Did I forget it again?

00:10:16.282 --> 00:10:19.762
It's all right. He was the same way.

00:10:19.786 --> 00:10:21.530
Turn around.

00:10:21.554 --> 00:10:24.733
It's ok. I can do it myself.

00:10:24.757 --> 00:10:27.970
He used to wash off here, too.

00:10:27.994 --> 00:10:32.274
He would always forget his towel
and then yell out to me.

00:10:32.298 --> 00:10:33.943
Who are you fighting this time?

00:10:33.967 --> 00:10:39.014
Some karate guy, I hear. Sounds like
it's not normal karate, though.

00:10:39.038 --> 00:10:42.318
One of these days,
you're going to die...

00:10:42.342 --> 00:10:49.658
He would always come home all torn up,
but then go straight back.

00:10:49.682 --> 00:10:53.162
Sometimes it was a judo fighter,
sometimes a karate fighter.

00:10:53.186 --> 00:10:55.531
Street fighters, Aikido fighters...

00:10:55.555 --> 00:10:58.167
He always had different opponents,

00:10:58.191 --> 00:11:01.403
and he never once came home unhurt...

00:11:01.427 --> 00:11:07.676
One day, after coming home in high
spirits like a bully who won a fight,

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:13.605
he passed away so blissfully,
leaving behind Kozue, his only child...

00:11:14.674 --> 00:11:19.855
When Tokugawa-san introduced you to me,
| was honestly hesitant.

00:11:19.879 --> 00:11:24.059
| thought I was sick of fighters...

00:11:24.083 --> 00:11:29.214
But whenever I hear those sounds,
I'm oddly put at ease...

00:11:31.991 --> 00:11:33.402
ow...!

00:11:33.426 --> 00:11:35.271
All done!

00:11:35.295 --> 00:11:37.072
Good luck with your next fight!

00:11:37.096 --> 00:11:39.208
Thanks!

00:11:39.232 --> 00:11:43.412
Oh, and you're late
with this month's rent.

00:11:43.436 --> 00:11:45.632
Oh, right...!

00:12:04.824 --> 00:12:06.535
Why aren't you eating?

00:12:06.559 --> 00:12:09.824
| went to the trouble of getting
a private room. Don't hold back.

00:12:12.565 --> 00:12:14.810
Well, whatever.

00:12:14.834 --> 00:12:20.249
| hear you earned quite
a name in your profession.

00:12:20.273 --> 00:12:24.019
| bet you earned a lot as a bodyguard.

00:12:24.043 --> 00:12:27.590
I'll have you know it was 10 times
as thrilling as your dojo!

00:12:27.614 --> 00:12:30.593
So you've grown tired
of those thrills, too?

00:12:30.617 --> 00:12:34.263
That doesn't mean I'm gonna
let you teach me now!

00:12:34.287 --> 00:12:38.801
| use real fighting karate that's
been forged by guns and swords!

00:12:38.825 --> 00:12:43.285
Karate you can't hit anyone
in the face with seems so stupid now!

00:12:44.597 --> 00:12:49.728
Did you know eyeballs are warm
when you jab your fingers into 'em?

00:12:50.737 --> 00:12:54.416
I've known that quite a long time.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.286
Screw this! I'm leavin'!

00:12:57.310 --> 00:13:03.392
But that is precisely why you have
the right to inherit my techniques

00:13:03.416 --> 00:13:09.732
and why he invited you to where
the world's strongest man is chosen.

00:13:09.756 --> 00:13:13.035
Will you try squaring off with me?

00:13:13.059 --> 00:13:17.973
My karate is 10 times
more thrilling than a pistol.

00:13:17.997 --> 00:13:19.308
When?!

00:13:19.332 --> 00:13:21.232
Whenever you want...

00:13:40.153 --> 00:13:42.747
Crotch hits don't work on me.

00:13:43.589 --> 00:13:46.718
They're warm, you said?

00:13:48.227 --> 00:13:52.608
Your fighting forged by guns
and swords didn't work on me.

00:13:52.632 --> 00:13:55.244
Okinawan karate has a
technique called kotsukake,

00:13:55.268 --> 00:13:58.414
in which your testicles
are hidden inside your body.

00:13:58.438 --> 00:14:05.387
<i>That old man's underground arena
is full of guys using such moves.</i>

00:14:05.411 --> 00:14:06.422
What?!

00:14:06.446 --> 00:14:09.558
In short, whatever goes.

00:14:09.582 --> 00:14:12.961
There are no forbidden moves,
and lethal techniques are allowed

00:14:12.985 --> 00:14:16.398
if you perfected them yourself.

00:14:16.422 --> 00:14:20.736
It's there the strongest men are chosen.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:23.339
What's the matter? You're shaking.

00:14:23.363 --> 00:14:25.741
So it really exists...?!

00:14:25.765 --> 00:14:28.677
I'm an old alum.

00:14:28.701 --> 00:14:31.500
You'll love it, too...

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.545
Does that sound bother you?

00:15:03.569 --> 00:15:06.215
- It doesn't bother you?
--Not at all.

00:15:06.239 --> 00:15:11.487
--Did Dad used to do that a lot?
--Day and night.

00:15:11.511 --> 00:15:14.957
--It sounds like you know something.
--Does it?

00:15:14.981 --> 00:15:18.193
Why do you think Baki-kun does that?

00:15:18.217 --> 00:15:19.962
Why not ask him yourself?

00:15:19.986 --> 00:15:25.652
I can't. All he ever does
is grin back at me.

00:15:28.461 --> 00:15:29.986
It stopped.

00:15:32.465 --> 00:15:34.343
That question again?

00:15:34.367 --> 00:15:36.779
You can't ask me not to be interested.

00:15:36.803 --> 00:15:40.349
You never go to school
and you train morning to night.

00:15:40.373 --> 00:15:42.918
But I'm here today.

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:44.586
Listen seriously!

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:48.357
Sometimes you disappear
then come back all beat up...

00:15:48.381 --> 00:15:53.012
Actually... I'm aspiring to
be the world's strongest man.

00:15:54.053 --> 00:15:58.012
--You call that an answer?
--It's not?

00:15:59.592 --> 00:16:01.537
Morning!

00:16:01.561 --> 00:16:04.106
Pretty risky, this early in the morning!

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.929
Wait! It's not like that...!

00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:14.063
What?!

00:16:17.076 --> 00:16:19.221
This is the underground arena...?

00:16:19.245 --> 00:16:23.025
--It's a charade.
--A charade?

00:16:23.049 --> 00:16:25.661
When the construction of
the Tokyo Dome was announced,

00:16:25.685 --> 00:16:30.999
that old man had them build an
exceedingly private area underground

00:16:31.023 --> 00:16:33.068
in exchange for his
financial assistance.

00:16:33.092 --> 00:16:37.973
This is a fairyland of people
who seek absolute power.

00:16:37.997 --> 00:16:40.576
How good of you to come, Doppo!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.912
Sir! I'm here as per your invitation.

00:16:43.936 --> 00:16:47.702
Oh! Thanks for coming, too, kid!

00:16:56.749 --> 00:17:01.063
--Baki-kun! It's our turn to clean!
--Sorry, I gotta skip it!

00:17:01.087 --> 00:17:05.354
Wait! I'm not done with
this morning's conversation!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:17.546
I am here to pick you up,
Mister Grappler.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.937
Thanks, Matsuo-san!

00:17:26.212 --> 00:17:27.589
Was that...

00:17:27.613 --> 00:17:29.274
---Baku-kun?!

00:17:36.322 --> 00:17:39.519
What's wrong, Kato?
You look like a tourist.

00:17:43.529 --> 00:17:45.541
This isn't some joke, right?

00:17:45.565 --> 00:17:48.330
You're the one who wanted to come here.

00:17:59.712 --> 00:18:00.923
This for real?!

00:18:00.947 --> 00:18:03.358
The Dome's only supposed
to go two floors down...!

00:18:03.382 --> 00:18:06.228
I told you, it's a charade.

00:18:06.252 --> 00:18:10.211
This charade will end with my generation.

00:18:11.123 --> 00:18:13.468
The holy land of fighting
that has existed

00:18:13.492 --> 00:18:17.239
ever since the Tokugawa Period
300 years ago...

00:18:17.263 --> 00:18:19.789
Behold, its latest form...!

00:18:27.506 --> 00:18:30.485
"Seiryu”

00:18:30.509 --> 00:18:33.479
"Byakko"

00:18:35.815 --> 00:18:39.528
This place was beneath the Dome... 2!

00:18:39.552 --> 00:18:41.296
Well, Doppo?!

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:46.668
It's like night and day compared to
the one beneath Korakuen Stadium.

00:18:46.692 --> 00:18:49.438
Naturally, as the public
can never learn about this,

00:18:49.462 --> 00:18:55.744
we specially restrict it
to people who can keep secrets.

00:18:55.768 --> 00:18:59.247
Kato. Close your mouth.

00:18:59.271 --> 00:19:02.551
I'm... not dreaming, am I?

00:19:02.575 --> 00:19:04.686
To think such a world existed...!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.689
Ladies and gentlemen, it's the
moment you've been waiting for!

00:19:07.713 --> 00:19:14.496
Shortly, today's main event,
Total Fighting- Champion Hanma Baki

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:20.186
versus Shinogi-Style Karate-
Shinogi Kosho, will begin!

00:19:21.961 --> 00:19:23.505
Sir...

00:19:23.529 --> 00:19:27.943
The Ogre's son is
fighting Shinogi Kosho?!

00:19:27.967 --> 00:19:30.278
Who the hell's that?!

00:19:30.302 --> 00:19:34.383
Not so cross, my boy. He'll be out soon.

00:19:34.407 --> 00:19:37.707
Then you can see him clearly
with your own eyes!

00:19:39.412 --> 00:19:42.791
This is certainly exciting, sir.

00:19:42.815 --> 00:19:46.028
How long it's been
since I felt like this...

00:19:46.052 --> 00:19:48.196
Watch for yourself, huh?

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.688
"Seiryu Locker Room"

00:20:03.736 --> 00:20:06.314
As impressive a thirst as always.

00:20:06.338 --> 00:20:09.851
De-carbonated cola is high in energy.

00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:12.254
--Here you are.
--Thanks.

00:20:12.278 --> 00:20:15.590
Why is it that when I'm done taping up

00:20:15.614 --> 00:20:18.026
my whole body starts to itch

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:21.509
and I want to tear my opponent apart?

00:20:30.563 --> 00:20:33.089
"Seiryu”

00:20:33.966 --> 00:20:39.481
This atmosphere hasn't changed.
The calm before the storm...

00:20:39.505 --> 00:20:40.749
It's time.

00:20:40.773 --> 00:20:44.686
And now, for today's main event!

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:47.222
Hanma Baki versus Shinogi Kosho.

00:20:47.246 --> 00:20:50.443
Coming from the Byakko corner...

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:55.409
...the challenger, Shinogi Kosho!

00:21:01.393 --> 00:21:02.337
He jumped!

00:21:02.361 --> 00:21:05.240
He's "Cord-Cutter Shinogi".

00:21:05.264 --> 00:21:05.974
Cord...?

00:21:05.998 --> 00:21:08.865
I1t'll make sense soon enough.

00:21:09.702 --> 00:21:11.379
And here he is!

00:21:11.403 --> 00:21:14.483
The youngest and most exciting
fighter in the 300 years

00:21:14.507 --> 00:21:20.789
of this underground arena... The King!

00:21:20.813 --> 00:21:23.680
Coming from the Seiryu corner!

00:21:25.384 --> 00:21:28.597
Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:21:28.621 --> 00:21:32.267
--Baki-;BBaakl(ii?!!Baki!

00:21:32.291 --> 00:21:34.736
Here goes!

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:38.840
Baki! Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:21:38.864 --> 00:21:41.877
The undefeated champion! Look, Doppo!

00:21:41.901 --> 00:21:44.479
That's Hanma Baki!

00:21:44.503 --> 00:21:47.382
Champion?! He's just a runt!

00:21:47.406 --> 00:21:49.431
That boy...?!

00:21:54.713 --> 00:21:57.273
He has flair.

00:22:01.153 --> 00:22:04.589
Aside from the use of weapons,
everything goes!

00:22:46.365 --> 00:22:51.913
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:51.937 --> 00:22:57.519
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:57.543 --> 00:23:03.191
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:03.215 --> 00:23:08.196
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:13.735
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:13.759 --> 00:23:19.274
gently enveloped in love

00:23:19.298 --> 00:23:24.946
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:30.485
but they will be reborn

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:36.157
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:36.181 --> 00:23:41.642
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:51.664 --> 00:23:53.632
"Next Episode”

00:23:56.135 --> 00:23:58.413
The boy's title is "The King".

00:23:58.437 --> 00:24:00.482
He's the strongest, and undefeated.

00:24:00.506 --> 00:24:03.952
It is all for the day he challenges him.

00:24:03.976 --> 00:24:08.857
The men gather in the arena in search
of proof of being the strongest.

00:24:08.881 --> 00:24:16.665
The fingertips of the bold man possess the
energy of a lethal technique- the Cord-Cut.

00:24:16.689 --> 00:24:21.650
"Next Episode: The Cord-Cut”
